  /// endTime of an agreement. BeforeStartTime – A date used to filter
  /// agreements with a date before the startTime of an agreement.
  /// AfterStartTime – A date used to filter agreements with a date after
  /// the startTime of an agreement. BeforeLastUpdateTime – A date used to
  /// filter agreements with a date before the lastUpdateTime of an agreement.
  /// AfterLastUpdateTime – A date used to filter agreements with a date
