  /// agreement. Supported value includes PurchaseAgreement . OfferSetId – A
  /// unique identifier for the offer set containing this offer. All
  /// agreements created from offers in this set include this identifier as
  /// context. EndTimeBehaviorType – What happens to the agreement when it
  /// reaches its end date. Values include RENEW , REPLACE , and EXPIRE .
  /// EndTimeBehaviorReasonCode – The reason why the agreement doesn't renew
  /// at its end date. Values include PROPOSER_RENEW_OPTED_OUT ,
